    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohoe Spring are delighted to bring to the market this C. 50.9 Acre Residential Farm in 4 Roadside Parcels Including C. 34.2 Acres of Meadow Grazing with C. 16.7 acres of Forestry Habitat, 3 Bed Bungalow Yard with Large Range of Outbuildings. Private Setting C. 6km from Bawnboy Village. Folio CN525F. For Sale by Private Treaty in One or More Lots.\n\n \n\nForming folio CN525F, this attractive residential farm can be sold in 1 or more lots. Made up of 5 parcels, all located in close proximity to each other, with clearly defined stock proof external boundaries over 850 metres of public road frontage, these lands are predominantly made up of excellent quality grassland laid out in large practically sized fields. The parcel breakdown is briefly described as;\n\n24.3 acres of grassland including the bungalow yard. 4.05 acre roadside meadow. 5.8 acre roadside land. 10 acres of quality roadside forestry (primarily conifers). 5.75 acres of enclosed forestry (primarily conifers).\n\n \n\nThe bungalow, located at the end of a C. 250 metre private lane adjacent to the yard, extends to C. 104 sqm with accommodation comprising;\n\nEntrance hall (2.5 x 2.5), Hallway (4.3 x 1.2), Sitting room (4.5 x 3.4) with OFP, Living/Dining room (4.3 x 4.3) with oil fired range, Kitchen (3.0 x 2.3), Shower room (2.5 x 2.5), Bedroom 1 (3.8 x 2.7) with en-suite Bathroom (2.5 x 2.3), Bedroom 2 (3.8 x 2.8) with BIW Bedroom 3 (4.5 x 2.0) with Hot press.\n\nThe house requires modernisation throughout with the layout site lending itself to further extension.\n\n \n\nBuilt of block construction with plaster finish, slate roof timber windows. Would qualify for the SEAI Property Grants potentially other Property Refurbishment Grants.\n\n \n\nServiced by; Private well, electrical connection, oil fired central heating septic tank. Fibre broadband enabled area. Bungalow BER: G.\n\n \n\nSome of the lands also have potential for one-off sites (subject to planning permission).\n\nThe Yard, also accessed by a private lane has nearly 500 square metres of outbuildings including; 4 bay dry shed, cubicle house, garage, machinery shed, GP sheds, pens and workshops (Plan dimensions available).\n\n \n\nWith over 850 metres direct road frontage only 6km to the village of Bawnboy (N87). Wider amenities are located at Ballinamore (8.5km) Ballyconnell, (12.4km).Cavan Town is 30 minutes by car while Carrick-on-Shannon Enniskillen are both 40 minute drive. GPS: 54.08874, -7.722865.\n\n \n\nA fantastic opportunity for those seeking a ready to go start in farming, equestrian buyers or those already in farming seeking to enlarge their current holdings. For sale in 1 or more lots.\n\n \n\nViewing Highly Recommended By Appointment Only. \n\n \n\nGuide Price: POA\n\n"
      }
